{"title":"Young Red Dragon","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: breath: {\n            shape: {\n                kind: \"cone\",\n                rangeTiles: 6,\n                halfAngle: De\n            },\n            inhaleMs: 1e3,\n            cooldownMs: 12e3,\n            damageMult: 1.4\n        }</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 74 total, 8–27 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 100% of 4 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 4 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 4/4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 75% of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 7 total, 2–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">75% · 3/4</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-arms\" title=\"Dragonscale Arms - in 25% of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/01655d6cc28367cce40f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25% · 1/4</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2060, 352 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wind-Carved%20Rocks\">Wind-Carved Rocks</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2046, 377 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"young-red-dragon\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/baby-red-dragon\">Baby Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/red-dragon\">Red Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(70)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"Young Red Dragon\"></div><h3>Young Red Dragon</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>62</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 62)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>469</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.6</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3,100</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (12 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>5 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}